[312.33189, "o", "\u001b[8A\r\u001b[2K\u001b[1mRejudge\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[1mFresh\u001b[22m\u001b[2m | \u001b[22m\u001b[1mread-only\u001b[22m \u001b[2mread\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mgrep\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mfind\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mls\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mgit_diff\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2KReview ./shipping.js against ./shipping-spec.md. List the three most important probl\u001b[0m…\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  glm-5.2 (judge)      \u001b[2m  1.\u001b[22m writing      03s \u001b[2m…nd(base * 1.12)` rounds $5.60 to `$6.00\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[32m    ⎿ deepseek-v4-pro    ✓  done (08s | 0 tools)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[32m    ⎿ glm-5.2            ✓  done (1m59s | 1 tool)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[32m    ⎿ mimo-v2.5-pro      ✓  done (09s | 0 tools)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2mTotal 5m05s\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[312.335563, "o", "\u001b[8A\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m\u001b[1mRejudge\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[1mFresh\u001b[22m\u001b[2m | \u001b[22m\u001b[1mread-only\u001b[22m \u001b[2mread\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mgrep\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mfind\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mls\u001b[22m\u001b[2m, \u001b[22m\u001b[2mgit_diff\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2KReview ./shipping.js against ./shipping-spec.md. List the three most important probl\u001b[0m…\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[32m  glm-5.2 (judge)        ✓  done (2m35s | 1 tool)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[32m    ⎿ deepseek-v4-pro    ✓  done (08s | 0 tools)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[32m    ⎿ glm-5.2            ✓  done (1m59s | 1 tool)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[32m    ⎿ mimo-v2.5-pro      ✓  done (09s | 0 tools)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2mTotal 5m05s\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[312.353723, "o", "The exact tier code:\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m```js\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[36mif (weightGrams > 5) {\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36m  base = 20;\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36m} else if (weightGrams > 1) {\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36m  base = 8;\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36m} else {\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36m  base = 5;\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[36m}\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2m```\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mP0 — Weight is compared in grams against kilogram thresholds.\u001b[22m \u001b[33mweightGrams > 5\u001b[39m treats\r\n500 g as 500 kg: \u001b[33m500 > 5\u001b[39m is true, so every realistic order jumps straight to the \u001b[33m$20\u001b[39m\r\ntier instead of the correct \u001b[33m$5\u001b[39m tier. Order B (500 g, international) computes\r\n\u001b[33mMath.round(20 * 1.12) = $22.00\u001b[39m; it should be \u001b[33m$5.50\u001b[39m.\r\nFix: convert first, \u001b[33mconst kg = weightGrams / 1000;\u001b[39m, then compare \u001b[33mkg\u001b[39m against 1 and 5 —\r\nso 0.5 kg lands in the \u001b[33m$5\u001b[39m tier.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mP0 — Free shipping ignores the coupon.\u001b[22m The spec grants free shipping only when\r\n\u001b[33msubtotal - coupon >= $75\u001b[39m, but the code checks \u001b[33msubtotal >= 75\u001b[39m. Order A ($80 subtotal,\r\n$10 coupon → $70 after coupon) wrongly returns \u001b["]
[312.35373, "o", "33m$0\u001b[39m.\r\nFix: \u001b[33mif (subtotal - (coupon || 0) >= 75) return 0;\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mP1 — International surcharge rounds to the nearest dollar, not the nearest $0.50.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[33mMath.round(base * 1.12)\u001b[39m rounds $5.60 to \u001b[33m$6.00\u001b[39m; the spec wants \u001b[33m$5.50\u001b[39m.\r\nFix: snap to 50-cent increments — \u001b[33mbase = Math.round(base * 1.12 * 2) / 2;\u001b[39m\r\n"]
